                                "sense_id": "f3bdaf9d-630a-3ee4-8034-ef08ea513ce1",
                                "text": "Meddle not with them; for I will not give you of their land, no, not so much as a footbreadth; because I have given Mount Seir unto Esau for a possession."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3981b5b-1e68-4358-abe5-0bbdce5b7c0e",
                                "sense_id": "f3bdaf9d-630a-3ee4-8034-ef08ea513ce1",
                                "text": "Wherewith at a stroke he hewed\nThe millstone through and through,\nAnd Foot-breadth of Thoralf the Strong,\nWere neither so broad nor so long"
                            }
                        ]
